    "detailed_description": "My Fantasy Hostess Club is a twist on the management and turn-based RPG genre where you command your hostesses to charm customers with their social skills. Your task is to revive the popularity and standing of the infamous Opulence Haven Hostess Club!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3110410/extras/3ff503aed6b6bce3e69fba62cd0aa6ac.poster.avif?t=1728660537\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3110410/extras/3ff503aed6b6bce3e69fba62cd0aa6ac.webm?t=1728660537\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3110410/extras/3ff503aed6b6bce3e69fba62cd0aa6ac.mp4?t=1728660537\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Choose how your hostesses will respond to their customers. Order food or drinks, entertain them using exceptional social skills, or simply talk it out to keep them company<br></li><li> Each hostess has a unique personality, and you must match their quirks with the customer\u2019s preferences to initiate smooth-sailing hosting sessions.</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Initiate Marketing Campaigns</h2></h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3110410/extras/5f6eb3ea5aa79724f471fa464b7d41e1.poster.avif?t=1728660537\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3110410/extras/5f6eb3ea5aa79724f471fa464b7d41e1.webm?t=1728660537\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3110410/extras/5f6eb3ea5aa79724f471fa464b7d41e1.mp4?t=1728660537\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Cooperate with merchants in the city of Limerence to launch marketing campaigns like hosting fashion shows or emceeing a Pop Festival to boost your Club\u2019s popularity!<br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Sell limited edition merchandise for your Club, initiate photoshoots for a magazine, and convince Limerence\u2019s merchants during meetings to support your business<br></li><li> Host Club Meets where your hostesses can meet their fans while you make sure the event flourishes <br></li><li> Building strong social networks will reward you both Fairies and Prestige, two of the most important currencies to raise your Club to new heights</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Hang Out With Your Favorite Hostess</h2></h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3110410/extras/3e7875035bf4bd3f10cb2a01e86a1454.poster.avif?t=1728660537\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3110410/extras/3e7875035bf4bd3f10cb2a01e86a1454.webm?t=1728660537\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3110410/extras/3e7875035bf4bd3f10cb2a01e86a1454.mp4?t=1728660537\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Taking breaks from work is important so exploring the city and hanging out with the hostesses can take your mind off the usual work grind. Who knows? You might also find love down the line.<br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Hang out with your Club\u2019s hostesses to learn more about their likes, concerns, and stories. <br></li><li> Deepening your relationships with Opulence Haven\u2019s hostesses may teach them more skills that can be used during hosting sessions</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Secrets</h2></h2>A mystery is brewing within Opulence Haven as Limerence\u2019s Intelligence Agency is on the hunt for your Club\u2019s suspicious activities. What you find in the city may shine the truth on what really happens behind the scenes. Can you find all the clues?",
